{"synopsis":"Dari Studio yang membawakan <Talent-Swallowing Magician>\n\n\"Yang bertahan hidup bukanlah yang terkuat. Yang bertahan hidup adalah yang terkuat.\"\n\nSetelah keluar dari militer, Jin Seowoon tidak melakukan apa-apa selain bermain game seperti pecundang. Suatu hari, ia diundang ke dunia bernama \"Cloyd Survival\", yang mirip dengan game yang ia sukai.\n\nDi dunia itu, terdapat para master bela diri, raja-raja dari dunia lain, dan pembunuh-pembunuh terkenal...\n\nItu adalah kumpulan monster yang melampaui imajinasi manusia.\n\nJin Seowoon hanya memiliki satu tujuan—bertahan hidup dan menjadi salah satu dari sepuluh terkuat.\n\nInilah kisah perjuangan hidup dan mati Jin Seowoon.","alternative_title":"서바이벌로 세계 최강","author":"Yobi","artist":"Eorin Haku, Inoan","chapters":[{"number":"38","chapter":"38","slug":"c8467c17-44bb-4002-a5f3-90cbf71005cf","date":"2026-05-06","images":[]},{"number":"37","chapter":"37","slug":"7a78846c-eafb-4cd2-973b-aeec72f0cba8","date":"2026-05-03","images":[]},{"number":"36","chapter":"36","slug":"785c620d-1e0a-446a-bc62-9bd41f745cdb","date":"2026-05-03","images":[]},{"number":"35","chapter":"35","slug":"e7451879-c246-4abf-877e-5cffc1fd934e","date":"2026-05-02","images":[]},{"number":"34","chapter":"34","slug":"71e7f93d-b0ed-4561-b2a5-49f1e5d6a448","date":"2026-05-02","images":[]},{"number":"33","chapter":"33","slug":"5c4f20f3-41e5-4666-b25f-06a013eab1e6","date":"2026-05-01","images":[]},{"number":"32","chapter":"32","slug":"2a8087e8-551c-41ed-ad10-4aa3adc58ae8","date":"2026-05-01","images":[]},{"number":"31","chapter":"31","slug":"c7cfb82a-4be2-486a-ba01-d24cfa4498a1","date":"2026-04-28","images":[]},{"number":"30","chapter":"30","slug":"64291dfd-1da8-4c2f-b9b3-76a2a92faf20","date":"2026-04-27","images":[]},{"number":"29","chapter":"29","slug":"f9f99f75-92fe-41b5-ba5f-4263a44bca06","date":"2026-04-27","images":[]},{"number":"28","chapter":"28","slug":"8b780386-41c5-4a5e-8477-a179fdf0f5ba","date":"2026-04-26","images":[]},{"number":